= Eclipse Graphical Editing Framework documentation =

This help plug-in demonstrates how selected wiki content can be converted into Eclipse Help with the modular WikiHelp pipeline and Mylyn WikiText.

The checked-in source represents a Git-backed documentation store. The same renderer can consume pages synchronized from MediaWiki, GitLab Wiki, Confluence, or the static Eclipsepedia archive.

